title: sandbox
new-page: true
is-special: true
is-hand: true
go-to: sandbox_menu

= Sandbox Menu

@sandbox_menu

- @clear_hand: Clear Cards
- @make_adv_available: Make Advisors Available
- @editresources: Edit Resources
- @editbudget: Edit Budget
- @editrelations: Edit Party Relations & Coalition Dissent
- @editfactions_dissent: Edit CHP Factions' Dissent
- @editparamilitary: Edit Paramilitary Groups
- @editarmy: Edit Army
- @backSpecialScene: Exit Sandbox Menu

@clear_hand
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
if (Q.difficulty >= 0) {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main'] = [];
} else {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main.main_easy'] = [];
}
!}

Cleared all cards.

@make_adv_available
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 0;
!}

Made advisor actions available.

@editfactions_dissent

- @editleft: Edit Leftist Kemalists' dissent
- @editorthodox: Edit Reformist Kemalists' dissent
- @editmarxist: Edit Kemalist Marxists' dissent
- @editright: Edit Right Kemalists' dissent
- @editthirdworldist: Edit Third Worldists' dissent
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox

@editresources

- @add10resources: Add 10 Resources
- @add20resources: Add 20 Resources
- @add100resources: Add 100 Resources
- @subtract10resources: Subtract 10 Resources
- @subtract20resources: Subtract 20 Resources
- @subtract100resources: Subtract 100 Resources
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox

@add10resources
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += 10;
!}

Added 10 resources to the party's stockpile.

@add20resources
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += 20;
!}

Added 20 resources to the party's stockpile.

@add100resources
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += 100;
!}

Added 100 resources to the party's stockpile, stop being greedy.

@subtract10resources
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 10;
!}

Removed 10 resources from the party's stockpile.

@subtract20resources
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 20;
!}

Removed 20 resources from the party's stockpile.

@subtract100resources
go-to: sandbox_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 100;
!}

Removed 100 resources from the party's stockpile. This doesn't go to the homeless or anything, why would you do this?

