@editrelations

- @increaseaprel: Increase Relations With AP
- @decreaseaprel: Decrease Relations With AP
- @increasecgprel: Increase Relations With CGP
- @decreasecgprel: Decrease Relations With CGP
- @increasetiprel: Increase Relations With TIP
- @decreasetiprel: Decrease Relations With TIP
- @increasedprel: Increase Relations With DP
- @decreasedprel: Decrease Relations With DP
- @removedissent: Remove Coalition Dissent
- @maxdissent: Maximise Coalition Dissent
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox Menu

@removedissent
go-to: editrelations
on-arrival: {!
Q.coalition_dissent = 0;
!}

Removed coalition dissent.

@maxdissent
go-to: editrelations
on-arrival: {!
Q.coalition_dissent = 5;
!}

Removed coalition dissent.

@increaseaprel
