@editparamilitary

- @raisethkpcstrength: Raise THKP-C Strength
- @lowerthkpcstrength: Lower THKP-C Strength
- @raisethkpcmilitancy: Raise THKP-C Militancy
- @lowerthkpcmilitancy: Lower THKP-C Militancy
- @banthkpc: Ban THKP-C
- @unbanthkpc: Unban THKP-C
- @raisetkpmlstrength: Raise TKP/ML Strength
- @lowertkpmlstrength: Lower TKP/ML Strength
- @raisetkpmlmilitancy: Raise TKP/ML Militancy
- @lowertkpmlmilitancy: Lower TKP/ML Militancy
- @bantkpml: Ban TKP/ML
- @unbantkpml: Unban TKP/ML
- @raisedevyolstrength: Raise DEV-YOL Strength
- @lowerdevyolstrength: Lower DEV-YOL Strength
- @raisedevyolmilitancy: Raise DEV-YOL Militancy
- @lowerdevyolmilitancy: Lower DEV-YOL Militancy
- @bandevyol: Ban DEV-YOL
- @unbandevyol: Unban DEV-YOL
- @raisegrey_wolvesstrength: Raise the Grey Wolves' Strength
- @lowergrey_wolvesstrength: Lower the Grey Wolves' Strength
- @raisegrey_wolvesmilitancy: Raise the Grey Wolves' Militancy
- @lowergrey_wolvesmilitancy: Lower the Grey Wolves' Militancy
- @bangrey_wolves: Ban the Grey Wolves
- @unbangrey_wolves: Unban the Grey Wolves
- @raiseraidersstrength: Raise the Raiders' Strength
- @lowerraidersstrength: Lower the Raiders' Strength
- @raiseraidersmilitancy: Raise the Raiders' Militancy
- @lowerraidersmilitancy: Lower the Raiders' Militancy
- @banraiders: Ban the Raiders
- @unbanraiders: Unban the Raiders
- @raisetitstrength: Raise TIT Strength
- @lowertitstrength: Lower TIT Strength
- @raisetitmilitancy: Raise TIT Militancy
- @lowertitmilitancy: Lower TIT Militancy
- @bantit: Ban TIT
- @unbantit: Unban TIT
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox Menu

@raisethkpcstrength
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.thkpc_strength += 200;
!}

Raised THKP-C strength by 200.

@lowerthkpcstrength
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.thkpc_strength -= 200;
!}

Lowered THKP-C strength by 200.

@raisethkpcmilitancy
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.thkpc_militancy += 0.15;
!}

Raised THKP-C militancy.

@lowerthkpcmilitancy
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.thkpc_militancy -= 0.15;
!}

Lowered THKP-C militancy.

@banthkpc
go-to: editparamilitary
view-if: thkpc_banned == 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.thkpc_banned = 1;
!}

Banned the THKP-C.

@unbanthkpc
go-to: editparamilitary
view-if: thkpc_banned != 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.thkpc_banned = 0;
!}

Unbanned the THKP-C.

